    "updated_at": "2021-02-08T18:05:06Z",
    "body": "It looks like your issue is caused by the [process-control crate](https://github.com/dylni/process_control) not compiling on OpenBSD. They were quite responsive when I raised an issue with FreeBSD support, so you might want to try reporting this issue there.  Until this is fixed, you might be able to build starship by reverting #2171.\r\nThere's also currently an open PR working on integrating async execution (#2223) which would remove the need for this dependency in the future.",
